---
source: crates/pixi_manifest/src/manifests/workspace.rs
expression: "expect_parse_warnings(r#\"\n[workspace]\nname = \"foo\"\nchannels = []\nplatforms = []\nexclude-newer = \"7d\"\n\n[exclude-newer]\nopenssl = \"30d\"\n\n[pypi-exclude-newer]\nboltons = \"2025-01-01\"\n\"#)"
---
  ⚠ the top-level `[exclude-newer]` table of per-package cutoffs is deprecated and will be removed in a future release
    ╭─[pixi.toml:8:1]
  7 │
  8 │ ╭─▶ [exclude-newer]
  9 │ ├─▶ openssl = "30d"
    · ╰──── this table will be removed
 10 │
    ╰────
  help: per-package cutoffs other than a zero cutoff have no replacement, the cutoffs of `openssl` will stop working when the table is removed in a future release

  ⚠ the top-level `[pypi-exclude-newer]` table of per-package cutoffs is deprecated and will be removed in a future release
    ╭─[pixi.toml:11:1]
 10 │
 11 │ ╭─▶ [pypi-exclude-newer]
 12 │ ├─▶ boltons = "2025-01-01"
